sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MobileApp as Mobile App
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Redis as Redis Store
    participant SMSVendor as SMS Gateway Vendor

    MobileApp->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/otp/request (+97798XXXXXXXX)
    API->>Redis: Check Rate Limit (Max 1 req/60s)
    API->>API: Generate CSPRNG 6-Digit OTP
    API->>Redis: Store Argon2id(OTP + Salt) [TTL = 300s]
    API->>SMSVendor: Dispatch SMS OTP Payload
    API-->>MobileApp: 200 OK {"status": "SENT"}
